rule Molt_AUTO_1bc2e929_Unattributed_operator_fa
{
    meta:
        description = "Unattributed operator: fake CodeX for Windows download site hijacks WhatsApp accounts through linked-device pairing. ### Summary\n\nOn 19 November 2026, a fake download site for an AI coding agent associated with **an unattributed operator"
